    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86477" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προᾰλείφω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>coat, cover beforehand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				34.1
			</span></i>; <i>anoint beforehand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i>(?)ap.<i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				8.40.3
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαλείψασθαι τὸ πρόσωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.45
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Diph.Siph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.90a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>smear on to oneself beforehand,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο</span> Hermes Trism. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8(3).156
			</span></i>.</div>
